ch. The top two teams in each pool advanced to semi-final pools. In the semis, four teams in each pool contested a round-robin, but the results from preliminary pools were carried over. The top two teams in each semi-final pool advanced to a final round medal pool, again a round-robin with results from the semi-final pools carried over. The 3rd- and 4th-placed teams in the semi-final pools went on to a classification round for places 5-8, again contested as a round-robin, with results from the semi-finals carried over."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/38129"} "Water Polo, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "8 – 15 August 1936"] "\n" [:td {} "142"] "\n" [:td {} "16"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n142 (142/0)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n16 (16/0)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {:class "top"} [:a {:href "/results/38129"} "Water Polo, Men"]] "\n" [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} "Hungary"] [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/countries/HUN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/HUN.png"}] "HUN"]] "\n" [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} "Germany"] [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-c